        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/f04885/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-11T09:00:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was looking around the &gt;G forums, looking for forum games of sentinels in progress, and couldn't find any. Are they there, and I just don't know where to look? I've read through a completed game under the Events forum, but there's nothing obvious on the first or second page.</p><p>If there aren't any in progress, where do I look/post for future play-by-forum sentinels games?</p>",
